  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 750eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>This top-shelf Dakai Soundsystems upgrade kit adds real-time pitch adjustment, distortion control, and multi-profile voice masking.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Cyber-Mask Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> The Cyber-Mask now provides a +2 bonus to Acting and Interrogation checks, thanks to both physical and digital voice distortion. Incompatible with AudioVox.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to Grand from the From the Ashes LC for this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Cyber-Mask<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Skill bonuses aren't automated from an upgrade. Add bonuses.acting and bonuses.interrogation as Active Effects on the Cyber-Mask it enhances, or apply them by hand.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; External Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
